sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Express as Express.js API
    participant ML as FastAPI /v1/score
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant LC as LoanController

    Client->>Express: Submit loan application
    Express->>ML: POST 22-D feature vector
    ML->>ML: RF + IF + stacking to score s
    ML->>DB: Insert LOAN_RISK_ASSESSMENT
    ML-->>Express: s, SHAP top-3, anomaly report
    Express->>LC: commitRiskScore(keccak256(s || nonce))
    Note over LC: State SCORE_COMMITTED
    Express->>LC: revealRiskScore(s, nonce)
    Note over LC: State SCORE_REVEALED
    LC-->>Express: approveLoan allowed only in SCORE_REVEALED
    Express-->>Client: Await bank approver signature
